WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:04.738
Ta-da!

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:07.674
Hi, It's N-ko!

00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:12.612
Every Friday at this time, I will bring you The N-ko Show.

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:19.519
I plan to bring you my recommendations on Anime and movies,

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:21.321
anime quiz segments,

00:00:21.388 --> 00:00:22.756
Q &amp; A segments,

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.457
my monologue,

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:29.362
and other contents based on my personal preferences.

00:00:29.429 --> 00:00:33.767
I will do my best to make this into a show

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.469
where you can easily learn the charms of anime,

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:42.475
whether you're commuting, or getting ready for bed during your busy life.

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:49.182
Of course, I will be sharing the latest Netflix shows' information as well,

00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:52.118
so please check in every week.

00:00:52.185 --> 00:00:56.456
Now, let's start "The N-ko Show"!

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:59.993
Weekly favorites!

00:01:00.627 --> 00:01:05.632
This is a segment where I share anime and movies.

00:01:05.699 --> 00:01:08.868
My recommendations are based on my personal preference.

00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:12.572
I will categorize them into different themes.

00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:15.275
My first show's theme is this...

00:01:16.009 --> 00:01:17.444
You should binge-watch!

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:20.480
Anime series you just can't wait to see more of!

00:01:21.214 --> 00:01:25.452
My recommendation for the first anime to binge-watch is this!

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:27.954
THE PROMISED NEVERLAND.

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:29.723
This is an anime

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:32.258
about boys and girls

00:01:32.325 --> 00:01:35.228
who live at this certain facility,

00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:39.733
but it's a facility full of mysteries.

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:42.268
This is a mystery anime,

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:44.838
so you just can't wait to see what happens next!

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:49.542
You feel eager to solve the mystery as soon as possible!

00:01:50.076 --> 00:01:52.879
You want the leading characters to survive

00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:54.948
more than anything.

00:01:55.015 --> 00:01:57.984
You just want to cheer them on in this anime.

00:01:58.051 --> 00:01:59.919
Please watch.

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:01.488
Up next!

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:04.991
RE: ZERO -STARTING LIFE IN ANOTHER WORLD-.

00:02:05.492 --> 00:02:11.331
This anime is super, super, scary and full of suspense,

00:02:11.431 --> 00:02:14.267
but you just can't stop wanting more!

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:21.675
I wanted protagonist Subaru Natsuki to find happiness while I was watching this show.

00:02:21.741 --> 00:02:26.112
Subaru Natsuki has an ability called "Return to Death,"

00:02:26.179 --> 00:02:31.451
and he experiences several painful deaths.

00:02:31.518 --> 00:02:37.857
But he still continues to eagerly protect his loved ones.

00:02:37.924 --> 00:02:43.363
This anime portrays Subaru Natsuki's passionate side.

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:47.400
And don't be satisfied just watching it once.

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:50.370
You will find something new

00:02:50.437 --> 00:02:52.706
on your second and third viewing,

00:02:52.772 --> 00:02:56.509
so I'd like you to binge-watch it several times!

00:02:56.576 --> 00:02:58.011
The next anime is this...

00:02:58.745 --> 00:03:00.046
ATTACK ON TITAN.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:03.216
It's one foreshadowing after another.

00:03:03.616 --> 00:03:06.820
Numerous mysteries are embedded in the storyline,

00:03:06.886 --> 00:03:10.023
such as mysteries of the Titans, mysteries of the world,

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:13.360
mysteries of lineage, and mystery of incidence.

00:03:13.426 --> 00:03:17.664
Soon as they're solved, another mystery arises.

00:03:17.731 --> 00:03:20.266
When you binge-watch the whole series,

00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:22.669
you can watch the mysteries unravel

00:03:22.736 --> 00:03:25.605
along with Eren's maturing process.

00:03:25.672 --> 00:03:28.675
So you can immerse yourself while watching this show.

00:03:29.142 --> 00:03:32.512
Anyhow, it's packed with a massive amount of information.

00:03:32.579 --> 00:03:34.214
All the way to the final season,

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:38.551
I recommend you to watch every season.

00:03:38.618 --> 00:03:39.786
The next is

00:03:39.853 --> 00:03:42.722
CODE GEASS: LELOUCH OF THE REBELLION.

00:03:43.123 --> 00:03:45.692
It includes season two as well.

00:03:45.759 --> 00:03:47.060
This series

00:03:47.127 --> 00:03:50.730
has lots of information to cover as well.

00:03:50.797 --> 00:03:53.366
Several countries are involved,

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:55.735
and it has numerous characters.

00:03:55.802 --> 00:03:59.572
People of different lineages appear,

00:03:59.639 --> 00:04:02.442
making its outlook very complicated.

00:04:02.509 --> 00:04:06.880
I would like you to watch it with your full attention.

00:04:06.946 --> 00:04:10.250
I would like you to immerse yourself in this world,

00:04:10.316 --> 00:04:14.421
learning the settings and the story's history,

00:04:14.487 --> 00:04:20.593
while enjoying each character and their relationships.

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:26.933
Each episode unfolds important elements as the story develops.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:33.740
There's even an event where you'll constantly say, "What? Don't end now!"

00:04:33.807 --> 00:04:39.179
This is a series that compels you to click "Next Episode."

00:04:39.245 --> 00:04:41.047
The last one is this.

00:04:41.114 --> 00:04:43.350
DEVILMAN CRYBABY.

00:04:43.416 --> 00:04:46.986
This is my absolute favorite anime!

00:04:47.053 --> 00:04:51.091
This is the anime that segued my working for Netflix.

00:04:51.524 --> 00:04:55.462
In other words, this is a very important anime for me.

00:04:55.895 --> 00:04:59.366
However, it's very dark and grotesque,

00:04:59.432 --> 00:05:02.035
even from episode one.

00:05:02.102 --> 00:05:05.638
I recommend preparing yourself prior to watching it.

00:05:05.705 --> 00:05:09.976
After I binge-watched it, I became somber.

00:05:10.043 --> 00:05:13.480
It's a unique anime packed with

00:05:13.546 --> 00:05:16.516
the charms of Go Nagai's manga,

00:05:16.583 --> 00:05:21.087
and director Masaaki Yuasa's perspectives.

00:05:21.154 --> 00:05:24.124
It's just 10 episodes, so you can watch it fast.

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:26.226
Binge-watching it is highly recommended.

00:05:26.292 --> 00:05:30.497
You'll finish watching today's recommendations quickly.

00:05:30.563 --> 00:05:32.532
You'll be curious about what happens next,

00:05:32.966 --> 00:05:34.567
so please watch them.

00:05:34.634 --> 00:05:37.704
That's it for my weekly favorites!

00:05:38.872 --> 00:05:40.440
N-ko English.

00:05:41.207 --> 00:05:46.046
In this segment, I will share how to say anime quotes in English.

00:05:46.112 --> 00:05:50.517
Let's learn to say anime quotes in English,

00:05:50.583 --> 00:05:54.721
when you want to say the anime quote in English in your daily life,

00:05:54.788 --> 00:06:00.326
or when you have an opportunity to befriend an anime fan abroad.

00:06:00.393 --> 00:06:03.363
This is today's quote.

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:07.000
"You've crossed a line you shouldn't have crossed."

00:06:07.067 --> 00:06:11.204
You've crossed a line you shouldn't have crossed.

00:06:11.271 --> 00:06:15.275
This is one of the popular quotes from BAKI.

00:06:15.342 --> 00:06:18.845
Let's remember it for when you have a chance to use it!

00:06:18.912 --> 00:06:20.714
A little tip on pronunciation...

00:06:21.147 --> 00:06:26.920
Put an emphasis on "crossed" when you say it.

00:06:26.986 --> 00:06:30.924
Everyone, let's use quotations in your daily life!

00:06:32.359 --> 00:06:35.395
N-ko's Q &amp; A section!

00:06:35.829 --> 00:06:40.633
As the name suggests, this is a segment where you can ask me any question,

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:43.903
as a VTuber and an employee of Netflix.

00:06:44.236 --> 00:06:50.460
Please post your questions on Twitter or my YouTube channel comments.

00:06:50.545 --> 00:06:53.215
So ask away!

00:06:53.281 --> 00:06:56.318
Now, I'll start answering your questions!

00:06:56.385 --> 00:06:57.686
Here's the first question.

00:06:57.753 --> 00:06:59.588
What is your favorite animal?

00:06:59.654 --> 00:07:00.989
I like the cheetah!

00:07:01.056 --> 00:07:04.559
You might ask, "It's not sheep?"

00:07:04.626 --> 00:07:06.877
But cheetah is just so cool,

00:07:06.962 --> 00:07:11.233
it's an animal that represents my ideal woman.

00:07:11.299 --> 00:07:16.772
She-cheetahs hunt, raise their cubs,

00:07:16.838 --> 00:07:21.810
and yet they are the fastest animal. That is so cool!

00:07:21.877 --> 00:07:27.816
I also love cheetah's beautiful legs and form!

00:07:27.883 --> 00:07:30.318
Here's the next question.

00:07:30.385 --> 00:07:32.421
What foods do you dislike?

00:07:32.487 --> 00:07:35.390
I don't dislike any particular foods,

00:07:35.457 --> 00:07:38.226
but I do have an allergy.

00:07:38.293 --> 00:07:40.262
I'm allergic to yam.

00:07:40.328 --> 00:07:43.398
That's why whenever I go to Osaka.

00:07:43.465 --> 00:07:46.068
I have to ask the servers,

00:07:46.134 --> 00:07:49.905
"Excuse me, do you use yam in this?"

00:07:49.971 --> 00:07:52.708
I have to do that every time.

00:07:53.108 --> 00:07:58.080
If yam is among the ingredients, I order Yakisoba instead.

00:07:58.146 --> 00:08:00.449
Here is the next question.

00:08:00.515 --> 00:08:03.785
Which do you prefer, aquarium or zoo?

00:08:03.852 --> 00:08:05.954
If I had to choose one,

00:08:06.021 --> 00:08:07.956
I prefer aquarium.

00:08:08.023 --> 00:08:12.494
It's because the aquarium is open not just on sunny days,

00:08:12.561 --> 00:08:17.232
but on rainy days too, both day and night.

00:08:17.299 --> 00:08:19.368
It could be enjoyed at any time!

00:08:19.434 --> 00:08:24.005
The aquarium is a popular dating spot too,

00:08:24.072 --> 00:08:28.910
so I'd like to go on a date while watching beautiful jellyfish.

00:08:28.977 --> 00:08:30.979
Here is the last question.

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:33.348
Where do you want to go the most right now?

00:08:33.415 --> 00:08:35.650
I would like to go to Europe.

00:08:35.717 --> 00:08:38.754
I've never been there,

00:08:39.221 --> 00:08:44.593
so I'd like to go to the parts of Europe with beautiful ocean views.

00:08:44.659 --> 00:08:47.262
Thank you for all your questions!

00:08:47.329 --> 00:08:51.666
I look forward to receiving questions from my current viewers!

00:08:51.733 --> 00:08:54.836
That's it for N-ko's Q &amp; A.

00:08:56.038 --> 00:09:00.342
So this is how "The N-ko Show" goes.

00:09:00.742 --> 00:09:03.745
Everyone, how did you like it?

00:09:03.812 --> 00:09:09.618
I'd love it if you found it informative and fun.

00:09:09.684 --> 00:09:15.057
I'll be submitting "The N-ko Show" next week at the same time.

00:09:15.123 --> 00:09:18.060
If you thought "It's fun!" or "It's cute!",

00:09:18.126 --> 00:09:22.831
please subscribe and like the channel!

00:09:22.898 --> 00:09:26.935
Let's meet again next time! See you.

